ven-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Collis</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Chepurny</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>WH</given-names></name><name><surname>Harbeck</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Roe</surname><given-names>MW</given-names></name><name><surname>Holz</surname><given-names>GG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A cAMP and Ca<sup>2+ </sup>coincidence detector in support of Ca<sup>2+</sup>-induced Ca<sup>2+ </sup>release in mouse pancreatic &#x003b2; cells</article-title><source>J Physiol (Lond)</source><year>2005</year><volume>566</volume><fpage>173</fpage><lpage>188</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15860526</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1113/jphysiol.2005.087510</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Venkatesh</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Siddharta</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Joshi</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Pate</surname><given-names>SL</given-names></name><name><surname>Hasan</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Interactions between inositol 1,4,5-trisphosphate and cAMP signaling pathways regulate larval molting in <italic>Drosophila</italic></article-title><source>Genetics</source><year>2001</year><volume>158</volume><fpage>309</fpage><lpage>318</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11333238</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hasan</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosbash</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title><italic>Drosophila </italic>homologs of two mammalian intracellular Ca<sup>2+</sup>-release channels: identification and expression patterns of